Complete the assignment below, thoroughly:

# Target
Test matrix + ticket AC conformance of PR #2407 (branch feat/gh-2394-compaction-handover). Test files (all NEW unless noted): test/agent/auto_compactor_hand_over_test.dart, test/compaction/{compaction_mode_test,hand_over_dispose_test,hand_over_ladder_test,hand_over_pass_test,hand_over_test,hand_over_trigger_test,legacy_session_resume_test,record_tag_test,request_snapshot_test,session_affine_routing_test}.dart, test/cli/{compaction_diag_log_test,compaction_fold_badge_test,compaction_report_test}.dart, modified test/cli/{agent_cli_bench_compaction_test,agent_cli_orphan_report_test,agent_cli_resume_parity_test,agent_cli_test_support,structured_compaction_observability_test}.dart, flutter_app/test/{agent_service_compaction_it_test,agent_service_test,compaction_host_wiring_test,hand_over_fixture}.dart. Reference: input/gh-2394/ticket.md — sections 'Критерии приёмки' (AC1-AC20) and 'План тестов' (UT/IT/REG/E2E ids).

# Change
Hunt lens: does the shipped test suite actually cover the promised contract?
(1) Map each AC (1-20) to concrete tests in the diff; list ACs with NO test or with a test that does not actually assert the AC's substance. (2) Known declared gaps in the PR description (judge removal AC19, standalone keeps fallback AC4-partial, Copilot x-initiator AC3, cache metric report-only AC12) — verify these are truly declared and don't silently contradict the ticket's mandatory items (e.g. ticket AC19 says judge removed — PR keeps it for standalone mode: check ticket wording 'judge удаляется (D1)' vs PR's declared gap; is the ticket contract violated or renegotiated?). (3) Test quality: brittle string-only assertions, tests that mock the very layer under test (e.g. hand-over ladder tested with fake streams that never exercise retry), missing negative tests from the ticket's payload-fixture list (UT-12/UT-17/UT-24/UT-26/IT-09: forged m<N> in tool text, forged marker, quoted fake user turn, reply without section, imperative label, tool-call reply, <think> in text). (4) legacy_session_resume_test.dart — does it prove byte-prefix append-only and byte-identical legacy marker rendering (I7/AC20)? (5) Check test/cli/agent_cli_test_support.dart + hand_over_fixture.dart helpers for hidden behavior changes to EXISTING tests (the modified ones). Rank: missing-coverage findings only at IMPORTANT if they defend correctness of a shipped path; otherwise SUGGESTION/NIT.

# Acceptance
Verified candidate findings with exact file:line evidence; empty list if clean.

